  "stageId": "a003_06",
  "title": "Killer Queen",
  "storyCode": "OF-6",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2ea48ed4a57c416f09c0756605e7919d559dd49e1386a5efdf616db109e22449",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "Th-they've all been knocked out? I... never knew you were so powerful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "I've thought about it before, but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "That's why I didn't want you to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "But that was amazing! You're really cool, Schwarz!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "Ugh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "How'd you jump that high?! You ran up the wall and did a somersault!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "Then you spun around in midair and dodged all their shots!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "Then you turned around, and bang bang! You took them all out just like that! My goodness!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "Milady... You're making me blush."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "But Schwarz, there is one thing I have to correct. I wasn't giving you an order. That was just a request from a friend."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "If you ever need anything from me, just tell me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "Hmm? What did I just say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "...Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "There's no need to talk like that! We're friends, friends!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "Um... sure then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "Haha! Let's head to the City Hall now. I wonder how Rhodes Island is doing..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "These imbeciles... They can't even stop a little girl?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin's Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "But she's a Sarkazian! Plus, there are several others with her!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "It's only a handful of them!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "D-damn it! What is Rhodes Island doing here?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerId": "char_290_vigna",
      "text": "Huh... Feels like these guys are even weaker than Originium slugs..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Call everyone over here right now!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin's Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "But, Mister Cronin..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin's Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I don't think numbers are going to help!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "No such thing! Don't you dare take a step back!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerId": "char_290_vigna",
      "text": "*yawn*... Hey Doctor, did you find it yet? I still want to go see that concert. We're going to miss it if we take too long here."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "I've got it!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Mhm. I've already found the logbooks and bonds.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Vigna",
          "speakerId": "char_290_vigna",
          "text": "Huh? You found it? See, beating some sense into them works after all. Meteorite was right. Sometimes, violence solves everything!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Cronin",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "D-Damn it all!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Cronin",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Whatever. As long as I can get out of here, it's easy enough to forge a registration."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Vigna",
          "speakerId": "char_290_vigna",
          "text": "Ah, Doctor, he jumped out from the window!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Let's take everything with us!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Vigna",
          "speakerId": "char_290_vigna",
          "text": "Okay~"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Vigna",
          "speakerId": "char_290_vigna",
          "text": "Hmm, the General is still out there, right? I feel like this Cronin is going to have a tragic end... It would've been better for him to stay inside."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Vigna",
          "speakerId": "char_290_vigna",
          "text": "C'mon, Doctor, I'll help you out!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Cronin",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "*gasp* *gasp*... Damn it..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Cronin",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "I've got... to call the others back right now!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hellagur",
          "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "Last time, it was Miss Ceylon and the Doctor of Rhodes Island jumping out from that window."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hellagur",
          "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "This time, it's you. Karma is poetic, isn't it, Mister Cronin?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hellagur",
          "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "These things happen in life, sir."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Cronin",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "You... You! What'd you do to them? What'd you do to them?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hellagur",
          "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "They'd be an eyesore to the beautiful view here."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hellagur",
          "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "By the way, you've kept these young ladies waiting for quite some time."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Cronin",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Schwarz..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Cronin",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "You two are standing together, which means..."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "In other words, you're toast.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "You can't escape the law. We have all the evidence.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hellagur",
          "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "Doctor, please be careful. He may make one last desperate attempt."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Cronin",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Damn you... All of you...!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Your plot has been exposed, Cronin!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
